# The code-to-runtime layout (src/isoline/compiler/ContextLayout.hpp), which every CI host must
# reproduce byte for byte (ContextLayout.matchesTheGolden): generated code addresses these fields by
# offset, so a host or standard library that lays them out differently would generate different code.
# One line per field: record, field, offset, size. Changing the layout is changing this file.
PendingAbrupt kind 0 1
PendingAbrupt code 1 1
PendingAbrupt subject 2 1
PendingAbrupt subjectBits 8 8
ExecutionState interruptFlag 0 8
ExecutionState stepsLeft 8 8
ExecutionState stackValuesLeft 16 8
ExecutionState callDepthLeft 24 4
ExecutionState nativeStackLimit 32 8
ExecutionState entryStackPointer 40 8
ExecutionState stubs 48 8
ExecutionState dispatch 56 8
ExecutionState pending 64 16
ExecutionState hostScratch 80 8
ExecutionState hostScratchCapacity 88 4
ExecutionState executorState 96 8
InstanceContext memory0 0 8
InstanceContext memories 8 8
InstanceContext tables 16 8
InstanceContext globals 24 8
InstanceContext typeIds 32 8
InstanceContext functions 40 8
InstanceContext moduleInstance 48 4
